  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Coastal Fisheries and Aquaculture for Pacific Livelihoods, Food and Economic Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the sustainability of coastal fisheries and aquaculture resources in the Pacific Islands region to improve food security and economic resilience. This Activity&#xA0;will strengthen&#xA0;legal and regulatory frameworks for better sustainable management, and support enhanced biosecurity, technical and business acumen for aquaculture enterprises in the Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
